# Valve Steam Deck's own controls: the back buttons are paddles
name deck
device_name Steam Deck
vendor 0x28de
product 0x1205
layout gamepad
joytype gamepad
gamepad_type steam standard
family steam
include gamepad-standard.inc
control l4 gbutton paddle2
control r4 gbutton paddle1
control l5 gbutton paddle4
control r5 gbutton paddle3
control steam gbutton guide
